    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "161df071e625f29fec255ab9515566dd",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div class=\"mnist-prose mnist-supporting\"><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-configure-the-2d-local-chart-riemannian-metric\">2. Configure the 2D Local Chart &amp; Riemannian Metric</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Three validation digits <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((x_A, x_B, x_C)||)</marimo-tex> span an orthonormal 2D affine chart <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\varphi^{-1}(u^1, u^2) = x_A + u^1 e_1 + u^2 e_2||)</marimo-tex> in image space. Use the sliders to compare <strong>Euclidean Linear Steering</strong> against <strong>Riemannian Geodesic Steering</strong>.</span></span></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-0' random-id='e3e5049c-c4cb-94fd-9500-2734517ed466'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;Digit 3&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eStart digit (x_A)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Digit 0&quot;,&quot;Digit 1&quot;,&quot;Digit 2&quot;,&quot;Digit 3&quot;,&quot;Digit 4&quot;,&quot;Digit 5&quot;,&quot;Digit 6&quot;,&quot;Digit 7&quot;,&quot;Digit 8&quot;,&quot;Digit 9&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-1' random-id='4138d7cf-16e1-6c77-879a-a595eaaf44b8'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;Digit 8&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eTarget digit (x_B)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Digit 0&quot;,&quot;Digit 1&quot;,&quot;Digit 2&quot;,&quot;Digit 3&quot;,&quot;Digit 4&quot;,&quot;Digit 5&quot;,&quot;Digit 6&quot;,&quot;Digit 7&quot;,&quot;Digit 8&quot;,&quot;Digit 9&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-2' random-id='a78cf29c-177a-239a-0a6b-e8273f3f9a7e'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;Digit 5&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003ePlane reference digit (x_C)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Digit 0&quot;,&quot;Digit 1&quot;,&quot;Digit 2&quot;,&quot;Digit 3&quot;,&quot;Digit 4&quot;,&quot;Digit 5&quot;,&quot;Digit 6&quot;,&quot;Digit 7&quot;,&quot;Digit 8&quot;,&quot;Digit 9&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-3' random-id='15ccbd7c-a174-cd47-16fc-05da8f46f26d'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;Pullback Activation Metric g_ij = (J_h^T J_h)_ij&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eRiemannian Metric on Chart&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Pullback Activation Metric g_ij = (J_h^T J_h)_ij&quot;,&quot;Pullback Fisher Information Metric g^F_ij&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex